{"fields":[{"t":"B","v":"false","n":"HasIntroAudio"},{"t":"A","v":"intro","n":"IntroAudio"},{"t":"B","v":"true","n":"HasPromptAudio"},{"t":"A","v":"prompt","n":"PromptAudio","s":"Quelles sont les 6 couleurs que l'on trouve dans un sachet de M&M's au chocolat au lait ?"},{"t":"B","v":"false","n":"HasClueAudio0"},{"t":"A","v":"answers_0_hint","n":"ClueAudio0"},{"t":"B","v":"false","n":"HasClueAudio1"},{"t":"A","v":"answers_1_hint","n":"ClueAudio1"},{"t":"B","v":"true","n":"HasClueAudio2"},{"t":"A","v":"answers_2_hint","n":"ClueAudio2","s":"Why not type in the color of the sun, just for giggles? After all, the sun is chocolate's greatest enemy."},{"t":"B","v":"true","n":"HasClueAudio3"},{"t":"A","v":"answers_3_hint","n":"ClueAudio3","s":"Freshly cut grass, guacamole, and M&M'S are all this color... weirdly enough."},{"t":"B","v":"false","n":"HasClueAudio4"},{"t":"A","v":"answers_4_hint","n":"ClueAudio4"},{"t":"B","v":"true","n":"HasClueAudio5"},{"t":"A","v":"answers_5_hint","n":"ClueAudio5","s":"Have you considered typing in the color of chocolate itself? Just an idea."},{"t":"B","v":"true","n":"HasFollowupAudio"},{"t":"A","v":"followup","n":"FollowupAudio","s":"Mmm, M&M'S. They're also one of my favorite road trip snacks, just in case that comes up later in the game."},{"t":"B","v":"false","n":"HasOutroAudio"},{"t":"A","v":"outro","n":"OutroAudio"}]}
